I am sitting at my desk.
There is a notebook and a pen in front of me.
The kitchen cupboards are empty.
I need groceries for the house.
I am making a list of items.
First of all, I want rice and dal.
I write them in the notebook.
I also want some spices.
I write the names of the spices.
Now I think about fruits.
I like fresh fruits a lot.
I like apples and bananas.
I write fruits on the list too.
I want some vegetables as well.
I write the names of tomatoes and spinach.
Now my list is ready.
It is a long list.
I pick up my cloth bags.
I am going to the market.
